wuka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "कटुक [kaṭuka], a.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Sharp, pungent; मधुरो गुडः कटुकं शृङ्गबेरम् Mbh. on P.II.1.1.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Impetuous, hot; Rv.1. 85.34.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Disagreeable, unpleasant.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Fierce. स संप्रहारस्तुमुलः कटुकः शोणितोदकः Mb.6.7.12.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Harsh; यदा ह्यस्य गिरो रुक्षाः श्रुणोमि कटुकादयाः Mb.12.1.4.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कः Pungency, acerbity.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "N. of several plants: पटोल, सुगन्धितृण, कुटज, अर्क, राजसर्षप. -का N. of several plants: कटुरोहिणी, ताम्बुली, राजिका, तिक्तालावुक. -की = कटुरोहिणी.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कम् Pungency; (at the end of comp. in a bad sense; as दधिकटुकम् 'bad curds').", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "A compound of ginger, black and long pepper.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "unpleasant works, speech; क्षमिणं तादृशं तात ब्रुवन्ति कटुकान्यपि Mb.3.28.13. -Comp. -आलाबु (बू) f. a kind of bitter gourd. -त्रयम् a compound of ginger, black and long pepper. -फलः = कक्कोल (Mar. कंकोळ). (-लम्) N. of a perfume prepared from the berries of this plant. -बदरी N. of a plant, as also of a town. कटुबदर्या अदूरभवं नगरं कटुबदरी Mbh. on P.I.2.51. -रोहिणी = कटुरोहिणी. -वल्ली = कटी.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["kaTuka", "kaṭuka"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kaTuka", "kaṭuka"]}, {"id": "kawukA", "headword": "कटुका", "headword_slp1": "kawukA", "fold": "kawuka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "कटुका [kaṭukā], f. N. of plant, Picrorrhiza Kurroa (Mar. कुटकी, बाळकडू).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["kaTukaa", "kaṭukā"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kaTukaa", "kaṭukā"]}], "kawukata": [{"id": "kawukatA", "headword": "कटुकता", "headword_slp1": "kawukatA", "fold": "kawukata", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "क